  "script": "Your Mac has a third input device\u2014and it's already in your hand.\n\nThis app turns your iPhone into a custom control panel for your Mac.\n\nTap once to open the apps you use every day.\n\nAdd a shortcut, and a whole workflow becomes one button.\n\nYou can even control windows with gestures.\n\nIt needs a companion app on your Mac and the same Wi\u2011Fi\u2014but once it's set up, your most-used actions live right beside your keyboard.\n\nComment APP and we'll send the exact one.",
